rem Ordered Radicals
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=124
rem Find the Kth number when 1 to Limit
rem is sorted by radical, then by value

use sequences
use io
use cli

arg Limit integer = 100000
arg K integer = 10000

Rad = array shape (Limit + 1) fill 1
for P in primes to Limit
  Rad (P to Limit by P) *= P
end
Order = Rad drop 1 argsort
Answer = Order (K - 1) + 1
Answer print
